<title>USA: City Securities Corp wins South Bend, Ind. $43 mln.</title>
<headline>City Securities Corp wins South Bend, Ind. $43 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Securities Corp said it won $43 million of South Bend Community School Corporation, Riley School Building Corporation, Ind., first mortgage bonds, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.66 percent.</p>
</text>
